# What must not be uploaded to the build.
#
# The CLI uploads the working tree, and `vercel link` writes a .env.local holding a live
# OIDC token — a credential that has no business in a build context. Local build output is
# excluded too: the build regenerates it, and shipping a stale copy would mean a deployment
# whose pages came from whatever was last built on somebody's laptop.
.env
.env.*
.vercel
deploy/out
node_modules
